    "body": "In the tuple-input path, `actual_num_heads` remains `self.num_heads`. Under DCP or any scenario where the tuple has a different head count than `self.num_heads`, this can pass the wrong `actual_num_heads` into `_forward_bf16_kv` and lead to incorrect output slicing/padding behavior. Set `actual_num_heads` from `ql_nope.shape[1]` (consistent with the non-tuple path), and use that value in the NoPE fast-path copy as well.",
    "created_at": "2026-09-08T13:52:53Z",
