    "body": "perf gain is real but small, and there's also one open correctness-adjacent issue: the FA backend deterministically hits an IMA in the `generic _compute_slot_mappings_kernel` with `--no-enable-prefix-caching` on this hybrid model (generic infra, fires only on FA's builder flags). \r\nSo I'd rather land the backends opt-in now and flip the default later once that's fixed and the paths have mileage — a one-line change in `_get_backend_priorities`",
